import{_ as a,o as t,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 135 | Realm Refinement · Dao Integration Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 135 | Realm Refinement · Dao Integration Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","no":135,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Dao Integration Realm","Human Race","Male","Cultivation Path"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","51-Human Positioning and Traits","17-Plane Transcendent Standard","49-Governance Framework and Checks and Balances"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0135_模块1-合道境-男性人族修炼路径.md","filePath":"en/0135_模块1-合道境-男性人族修炼路径.md"}'),n={name:"en/0135_模块1-合道境-男性人族修炼路径.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,u,m){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-135-dao-integration-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" tabindex="-1">Entry 135 | Dao Integration Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-135-dao-integration-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 135 | Dao Integration Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 51, 17, 49</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-apex-of-the-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-the-heaven-human-leap-from-attaining-the-dao-to-dao-integration" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The apex of the five mortal-cultivation realms, the heaven-human leap from &quot;attaining the Dao&quot; to &quot;Dao integration&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-apex-of-the-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-the-heaven-human-leap-from-attaining-the-dao-to-dao-integration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The apex of the five mortal-cultivation realms, the heaven-human leap from &quot;attaining the Dao&quot; to &quot;Dao integration&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Male humans in the Dao Realm (Entry 128) established their own Dao; Dao Integration answers a question that reaches the apex of the five mortal-cultivation realms: can the personal Dao &quot;merge into the cosmos.&quot; Per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), Dao Integration&#39;s core is &quot;Dao integration&quot;: the personal Dao deeply fuses with cosmic origin laws, reaching &quot;heaven-human unity&quot;; can rewrite local law operation over a large range; life form begins high-dimensional evolution, partially freeing itself from the physical body; can create a stable personal domain (law domain). This realm&#39;s breakthrough is <strong>a cosmic-level event requiring right timing, right place, right people</strong>; those who complete it are civilization&#39;s &quot;grandmasters,&quot; top in every field, with important influence on civilization&#39;s direction — after Dao Integration, one enters the four sacred-cultivation realms.</p><p>The six top-level axioms enter the &quot;Dao integration stage&quot; in Dao Integration: the anti-predation axiom — Dao integration is not swallowing the cosmos, but symbiosis with the cosmos; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — Dao Integration&#39;s door remains open to all Myriad Races; the collective ascension axiom — grandmaster-tier beings&#39; job is precisely to &quot;lift Myriad Ranks up together&quot;; the causal self-discipline axiom — rewriting local laws is the highest-risk operation, most requiring observe-first, interfere-second; the law-first axiom — Dao Integration&#39;s &quot;heaven-human unity&quot; legal definition is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-dao-integration" tabindex="-1">I. Portrait of Male Humans in Dao Integration <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-dao-integration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Portrait of Male Humans in Dao Integration&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Male humans who cross the Dao Realm enter a &quot;grandmaster&#39;s perspective&quot;:</p><ul><li>Strong sense of responsibility, understanding Dao integration as &quot;upholding civilization&#39;s direction&quot;; suited for grandmaster positions</li><li>Strong domain desire, initial law domain creation makes him think &quot;my domain my rules&quot;; prone to conflict with others&#39; domains</li><li>Initial high-dimensional sensation: life form partially frees itself from the physical body, beginning to understand &quot;I am not just this body&quot;</li><li>Reverence for cosmic-level breakthrough: knowing this leap is a cosmic event, instead generates the deepest humility</li></ul><h2 id="ii-cultivation-path-from-attaining-the-dao-to-heaven-human-unity" tabindex="-1">II. Cultivation Path: From Attaining the Dao to Heaven-Human Unity <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-cultivation-path-from-attaining-the-dao-to-heaven-human-unity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Cultivation Path: From Attaining the Dao to Heaven-Human Unity&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Under the unified classification, Dao Integration has four milestones; male humans must actively self-correct:</p><ol><li>Dao-origin fusion: deeply fusing the personal Dao with cosmic origin laws, approaching &quot;heaven-human unity&quot;</li><li>Local law rewriting: fine-tuning local law operation over a large range</li><li>Life high-dimensionalization: life form evolves high-dimensionally, partially freeing itself from the physical body</li><li>Law domain creation: creating a stable personal domain</li></ol><p>Male humans&#39; natural biases: over &quot;domain sovereignty&quot; under &quot;domain co-building&quot;; over &quot;rewriting laws&quot; under &quot;revering origin&quot;; over &quot;high-dimensional transcendence&quot; under &quot;mortal-cultivation responsibility.&quot; Anchor certification directly lists the purity of heaven-human unity, domain symbiosis, and law rewriting filing as assessment items.</p><h2 id="iii-pain-points-and-costs-dao-integration-backlash-and-domain-conflicts" tabindex="-1">III. Pain Points and Costs: Dao Integration Backlash and Domain Conflicts <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-pain-points-and-costs-dao-integration-backlash-and-domain-conflicts" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Pain Points and Costs: Dao Integration Backlash and Domain Conflicts&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Integration pain points are the deepest of the five mortal-cultivation realms:</p><ul><li>Dao integration backlash: the personal Dao fails to truly merge with origin, is &quot;bounced back&quot; by origin laws; Dao-heart and realm both collapse</li><li>Domain conflict: personal domain conflicts with others&#39; domains and public laws, triggering regional law turbulence</li><li>High-dimensional loss: after partially freeing from the physical body, existential confusion about &quot;who am I&quot;</li><li>Shortcut inner demon: the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon in this realm upgrades to &quot;swallowing cosmic origin for instant origin-level ascension&quot; — the predatory faction&#39;s ultimate temptation</li></ul><p>Breakthrough costs are real: cosmic-level breakthrough requires right timing, right place, right people, cannot be forced; but the Anchor Council and mentor system escort the breakthrough, costs are controllable.</p><h2 id="iv-breakthrough-features-from-dao-attainer-to-dao-integration-grandmaster" tabindex="-1">IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Dao-attainer&quot; to &quot;Dao Integration Grandmaster&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-breakthrough-features-from-dao-attainer-to-dao-integration-grandmaster" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Dao-attainer&quot; to &quot;Dao Integration Grandmaster&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Markers for male humans entering the Boundary-Breaking Realm (sacred cultivation) from Dao Integration:</p><ul><li>Heaven-human unity: the personal Dao truly fuses with origin laws, no more &quot;my Dao vs. cosmic laws&quot; crack</li><li>Domain symbiosis: personal domain harmoniously coexists with public laws and others&#39; domains, no mutual swallowing</li><li>High-dimensional ease: freely switching between material and high-dimensional, not lost</li><li>Grandmaster self-awareness: knowing Dao integration is only the start of sacred cultivation, bearing Myriad Races&#39; ascension on shoulders</li></ul><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-mortal-completeness-moves-to-sacred-boundary-breaking" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Mortal Completeness Moves to Sacred Boundary-Breaking <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-mortal-completeness-moves-to-sacred-boundary-breaking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Mortal Completeness Moves to Sacred Boundary-Breaking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Integration is the apex of the five mortal-cultivation realms; male human grandmasters must complete the identity switch from &quot;mortal cultivation&quot; to &quot;sacred cultivation&quot; before breaking through to the Boundary-Breaking Realm. The key reminder at handover: Dao integration is not the endpoint, but the start of sacred cultivation — he used to cultivate within the material plane; the Boundary-Breaking Realm requires learning stable cross-plane operation, needing to expand the personal domain into a small independent space. Male humans who treat Dao integration as &quot;stopping here&quot; get stuck at the threshold between mortal and sacred. The Anchor Council assesses before breakthrough whether he is psychologically and capably ready to &quot;lift Myriad Races up together&quot; — the responsibility of the four sacred realms officially presses on his shoulders from the Boundary-Breaking Realm onward.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: male sense of responsibility is civilization&#39;s scarce grandmaster resource; channeled toward &quot;lifting Myriad Races up&quot; is co-building</li><li>Anti-predation: institutionally cutting off the ultimate temptation of &quot;swallowing origin,&quot; Dao integration is symbiosis not swallowing</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: in the old-era universal welfare system, &quot;Dao integration&quot; was monopolized by the strong as being-above-others; in Heng Yuan Zhou, Dao integration is for lifting Myriad Races</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: the male human path shares 99% coverage with female humans (Entry 136) and all Myriad Races (Entry 138)</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: Dao Integration methods are free and public; the five mortal realms are complete here, the sixth link of the fully open chain</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Integration is the highest point of the male human&#39;s mortal-cultivation path. Predation teaches him to swallow origin and claim supremacy; symbiosis teaches him to merge into origin and integrate the Dao. Making heaven-human unity real, making the domain symbiotic, he completes all homework of the five mortal-cultivation realms, carries Myriad Races&#39; expectations, and moves toward the broad sky of the four sacred-cultivation realms.</p><p>In the final analysis, the Dao Integration male human cultivation path described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./51-人族定位与特质.html">51-Human Positioning and Traits</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a> · <a href="./49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">49-Governance Framework and Checks and Balances</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const g=a(n,[["render",r]]);export{d as __pageData,g as default};
